WEBVTT

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.830
From now on, you are Ultraman.

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:25.150
Ultraman?

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:27.800
I'm sure you've heard of us.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.160
I'm sure you've heard from your brothers.

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:33.580
We can meet again, right?

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.150
That planet's planet.

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:37.600
Look at the humans.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.780
By interacting with them, you too, like your brothers,

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:45.980
will be able to obtain something important.

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:48.740
I believe in it.

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:51.180
Something important?

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:54.380
Something that only you can find.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:05.720
Understood.

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:09.030
I'm going, Ultra Father.

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:11.920
Young warrior, go.

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.660
To the starless planet.

00:01:34.476 --> 00:01:36.136
I can do it right now

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:31.290
Now I'm going

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:38.120
ありがと。

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:01.390
A space monster has been confirmed?

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:04.930
There's no doubt about it, Miss Misaki!

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:07.150
This is a report from the General Headquarters of GAIZ.

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:09.460
The registration code is Dinozor.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:12.550
A waiting order has been issued to all countries of GAIZ.

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:15.150
Ah, what a misfortune.

00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:20.420
It's been a century since the last time a monster came to the market.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:23.010
To be exact, it's been 25 years and two weeks.

00:04:23.390 --> 00:04:25.530
You don't have to answer what you haven't heard.

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:29.010
But, more than 100 kilometers on Earth...

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:30.380
It's supposed to be a large space.

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:35.260
The V-77 is ready to attack.

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:39.760
One, go to school naked.

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:43.920
One, put a futon on a good day.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:47.480
One, be careful when walking on the road.

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:51.080
One, don't rely on other people's power.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:59.620
Run barefoot on the street.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:00.580
I'm going to go around and play.

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:07.390
I'm surprised that there's someone I know.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:10.910
This is my boss's habit.

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:15.200
I was taught by my friend when I was little.

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:18.250
It seems that Ultraman left a word.

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:21.180
Yes, I heard that too.

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:23.220
Don't laugh.

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:26.130
Ultraman is already a legend.

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:28.260
Now this planet is...

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:31.590
We're protecting it.

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:35.390
Ultraman?

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:39.080
Where and what are they doing now?

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:54.940
Yes, this is Aihara.

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:01.790
I'm in a state of emergency. Let's hurry.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:10.160
See you somewhere else.

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:02.940
Why do we have to leave behind the soldiers of the foreign countries?

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:11.820
The current orbit shows that Dinozor is 70% more likely to reach the Japanese airspace.

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:14.520
Finally, it's here.

00:07:49.430 --> 00:07:53.290
It's the first practice, but I believe you can do it.

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:04.090
Confirm the color!

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:30.520
cooking

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:25.120
If it's a ballet practice, it's the first time.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:34.540
Please study hard and become a good doctor, Mr. Teppei.

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:38.560
Soon after your father's death, you will be the director of this hospital.

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:43.800
Right now?

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:49.040
Sponsors are satisfied with this year's results.

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:50.950
Of course, I'm also.

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:54.930
I'm counting on you, Marina.

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:55.720
Yes.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.620
It's not a dream for all of Japan to go as it is.

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:05.880
No, I think I can go beyond that.

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:10.490
Beyond that? The World Championships?

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:17.900
The first monster alarm has been heard since the collapse.

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:20.620
In the area of 5 km around the forecast point of destruction of the monster,

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:22.640
a evacuation country has been launched.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:26.000
It's not over yet, Maru!

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:28.920
An emergency alarm has been launched.

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:29.840
Let's go!

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:32.290
Citizens, please do not rush to the next station.

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:36.050
The teachers are here, so it's okay.

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:43.300
Please leave it to the teacher.

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:44.200
Please.

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:16.500
So cute

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:22.080
It's scary

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:22.320
I'm just gonna walk

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:22.740
I'm here

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:22.880
I'm here

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:23.020
I'm not city

00:11:23.020 --> 00:11:23.900
I'm not city

00:11:23.900 --> 00:11:24.660
I'm here

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:24.820
I'm here

00:11:24.820 --> 00:11:25.600
I'm here

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:25.680
I'm here

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:29.960
I'm here

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:44.940
I'm sure Ikaru will be better at shooting.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:50.470
Let's go, Amigo.

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:52.320
Me too.

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:32.810
We're the only ones left!

00:13:07.836 --> 00:13:08.916
I won't let you do that.

00:13:19.292 --> 00:13:21.292
Thank you for watching!

00:13:30.444 --> 00:13:32.444
Thank you for watching.

00:13:52.332 --> 00:13:54.332
Let's go!

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:27.960
I'm sorry.

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:31.290
Yes!

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:33.340
Run away!

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:36.210
The monster is coming!

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:37.360
Run away!

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:39.540
We'll take good care of you guys!

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:42.650
Stand up!

00:15:42.970 --> 00:15:43.410
Yes!

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:32.870
Let's go!

00:17:44.876 --> 00:17:46.876
Are you serious?

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:09.380
Ah, Ultraman!

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:45.920
We'll be right back.

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:10.620
She's that.

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:50.720
Give me a minute!

00:21:01.980 --> 00:21:03.160
You're not going to protect me!

00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:34.800
Yes!

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:44.850
After all, here...

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:50.860
You're not Gaiju, are you?

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:55.740
Let me fight with you. I want to fight with you!

00:21:56.720 --> 00:21:58.500
Why are you so excited?

00:22:01.080 --> 00:22:01.820
You don't need a guide anymore!

00:22:04.140 --> 00:22:18.540
Let's go to Phoenix Nest.

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:21.060
There's someone waiting for you.

00:22:49.380 --> 00:22:52.550
The Gaiju headquarters has decided to deploy the Gun Phoenix, a combined attack fighter.

00:23:00.600 --> 00:23:01.040
Who are you?

00:23:02.800 --> 00:23:05.070
I'm Sakomitsu, the captain of the Shinsengaizu.

00:23:08.300 --> 00:23:09.360
I'm the first member of the Shinseng crew.

00:23:10.770 --> 00:23:11.530
Shinseng crew?

00:23:11.710 --> 00:23:13.410
Why are you here?

00:23:14.110 --> 00:23:14.930
Who are you?

00:23:14.930 --> 00:23:18.420
I'm Mirai Hibino. Nice to meet you.

00:23:21.450 --> 00:23:23.100
I'm a member of the Shinsengaizu crew.

00:23:24.100 --> 00:23:24.860
I see.

00:23:25.180 --> 00:23:26.320
The earth is ours.

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:28.530
We must protect it with our own hands.

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:31.240
We're going with our wings!

00:23:31.520 --> 00:23:32.340
Fly with us!

00:23:32.780 --> 00:23:35.210
Next time, on Our Wings.
